  "statement_html": " La courbe représentative de la fonction \\(f\\) définie par :\t\t\\(f(x) = x^{3} - 6 x + 11\\) est dessinée ci-dessous en bleu.\t<br>\tLa courbe représentative de la fonction \\(g\\) définie par : \\(g(x) = 2 x^{2} - 3 x\\) est dessinée en rouge.\t<br>\tLes droites dessinées en noir ont comme équations \\(x = -2\\) et \\(x = 1\\).\t<br>\tL'aire du rectangle noir est 1 unité d'aire.\t\t<div class=\"wimscenter\"><span class=\"pax-fig-group\">\t <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 300\"><path d=\"M111 26h25v1h-25zM102 27h43v1h-43zM96 28h56v1h-56zM91 29h66v1h-66zM87 30h75v1h-75zM83 31h83v1h-83zM80 32h90v1h-90zM77 33h97v1h-97zM74 34h103v1h-103zM71 35h110v1h-110zM68 36h116v1h-116zM66 37h121v1h-121zM64 38h126v1h-126zM61 39h131v1h-131zM59 40h136v1h-136zM57 41h141v1h-141zM55 42h145v1h-145zM53 43h150v1h-150zM51 44h154v1h-154zM50 45h158v1h-158zM48 46h162v1h-162zM46 47h166v1h-166zM44 48h171v1h-171zM43 49h174v1h-174zM41 50h178v1h-178zM41 51h180v1h-180zM41 52h182v1h-182zM41 53h184v1h-184zM41 54h186v1h-186zM41 55h188v1h-188zM41 56h190v1h-190zM41 57h192v1h-192zM41 58h194v1h-194zM41 59h196v1h-196zM41 60h198v1h-198zM41 61h200v1h-200zM41 62h202v1h-202zM41 63h204v1h-204zM41 64h206v1h-206zM42 65h207v1h-207zM43 66h207v1h-207zM44 67h208v1h-208zM44 68h210v1h-210zM45 69h211v1h-211zM46 70h212v1h-212zM47 71h212v1h-212zM48 72h213v1h-213zM49 73h214v1h-214zM50 74h215v1h-215zM51 75h215v1h-215zM52 76h216v1h-216zM52 77h218v1h-218zM53 78h218v1h-218zM54 79h219v1h-219zM55 80h220v1h-220zM56 81h220v1h-220zM57 82h221v1h-221zM58 83h222v1h-222zM59 84h222v1h-222zM60 85h223v1h-223zM61 86h224v1h-224zM61 87h225v1h-225zM62 88h226v1h-226zM63 89h227v1h-227zM64 90h227v1h-227zM65 91h228v1h-228zM66 92h229v1h-229zM67 93h229v1h-229zM68 94h230v1h-230zM69 95h230v1h-230zM70 96h231v1h-231zM71 97h232v1h-232zM72 98h232v1h-232zM73 99h233v1h-233zM74 100h233v1h-233zM75 101h234v1h-234zM75 102h236v1h-236zM76 103h236v1h-236zM77 104h237v1h-237zM78 105h237v1